Both are evaluable from a diff's changed-file list and content. No judgment-call language ("risky", "when it matters", "significant"). **Checkable — accepted on attempt 1.** The re-elicitation loop is not entered; 0 of the 3 attempts consumed; the bounded ALWAYS/N/A fallback is not offered. The N/A category rule does not apply (no N/A ruling this pass).

